#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_processes_apps.html.heex:841
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A process talks to another process only by a step drawn for it, a call or a signal. What a process writes, a message or a sub-group, starts no process, so two processes cannot spin in a circle by accident."
msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:22
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A profile is a member of a group and holds assignments of roles in it. A group has at most one manifest of its own, and a manifest holds roles with lists of what they allow and deny. An assignment and a role are joined only by the role's key."
msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/help_guides.ex:681
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A profile you set"
