#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_app_architecture.html.heex:22
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A project from the %{c1} template builds into one file, %{c2}, which is uploaded into a group's description marked as an app. For every viewer Potok puts a frame together: its own head with the SDK and the styles, and the uploaded HTML in the body."
msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_access.html.heex:162
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A role assignment is a record of the group in which the profile is a member, and a role is a record of a manifest, which may belong to an ancestor. Only the role's key joins them, so an assignment of a role the manifest in force does not have brings nothing. The role Everyone is assigned to nobody: every member holds it by membership itself."
msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_processes_apps.html.heex:541
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A sequence: a resident starts a fault report from the app, the manager picks an outcome in the app, the report calls the process Repairer, which hands back the entity Termin, and a message arrives in the fault's sub-group."
msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html/help_processes_apps.html.heex:853
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A tree of groups: the public process Repairer in Zgrada Cvetna 12 is called by processes of the group above and of the group below, but not of the neighboring building. A message a process writes does not start another process."
msgstr ""

